    "Not all the pairs are finished. Looking at the result now and deciding whether to go on would break the test: the exact p is only valid if the number of pairs was fixed in advance.": {
      "localizations": {
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Non tutte le coppie sono finite. Guardare il risultato adesso e decidere se andare avanti romperebbe il test: il p esatto vale solo se il numero di coppie era fissato in partenza."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Not all the pairs are finished. Looking at the result now and deciding whether to go on would break the test: the exact p is only valid if the number of pairs was fixed in advance."
