        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La forma delle feci usa una parte dei suoi livelli."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Stool form uses part of its range."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stress": {
      "localizations": {
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Stress"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Stress"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Symptoms move a lot on their own. Sleep, stress, coffee and the working week shift the numbers as much as food does.": {
      "localizations": {
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I sintomi oscillano molto da soli. Sonno, stress, caffè e il ritmo della settimana muovono i numeri quanto il cibo."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Symptoms move a lot on their own. Sleep, stress, coffee and the working week shift the numbers as much as food does."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap to add them to your catalogue. Whatever you skip still stays in the text of the meal.": {
      "localizations": {
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tocca per aggiungerli al tuo catalogo. Quello che non aggiungi resta comunque scritto nel testo del pasto."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tap to add them to your catalogue. Whatever you skip still stays in the text of the meal."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Target": {
      "localizations": {
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bersaglio"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Target"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The analysis is not shown because the plan changed after it was frozen.": {
      "localizations": {
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L'analisi non viene mostrata perché il piano è cambiato dopo essere stato congelato."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The analysis is not shown because the plan changed after it was frozen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The app is written in English. Italian is a translation, and the change takes effect right away.": {
      "localizations": {
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L'app è scritta in inglese. L'italiano è una traduzione, e il cambio ha effetto subito."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The app is written in English. Italian is a translation, and the change takes effect right away."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The daily score was assigned to every food eaten that day. Two foods always eaten together cannot be told apart, by any calculation.": {
      "localizations": {
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Il punteggio giornaliero veniva assegnato a tutti gli alimenti mangiati quel giorno. Due cibi mangiati sempre insieme non si possono distinguere, con nessun calcolo."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The daily score was assigned to every food eaten that day. Two foods always eaten together cannot be told apart, by any calculation."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The first %lld day of each block is left out of the calculation, to drop what carried over from the block before. It changes nothing in what you do.": {
      "localizations": {
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Il primo %lld giorno di ogni blocco resta fuori dal calcolo, per togliere quello che si trascina dal blocco precedente. Non cambia niente in quello che fai."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The first %lld day of each block is left out of the calculation, to drop what carried over from the block before. It changes nothing in what you do."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The frozen plan": {
      "localizations": {
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Il piano congelato"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The frozen plan"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The interval is at %@, not at 95%%: with this many pairs 95%% is not one of the levels that exist.": {
      "localizations": {
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L'intervallo è al %@, non al 95%%: con questo numero di coppie il 95%% non è fra i livelli che esistono."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The interval is at %@, not at 95%%: with this many pairs 95%% is not one of the levels that exist."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The pairs lean the same way often enough that chance alone is an unlikely explanation. That is not the same as proof, and one comparison is not a diagnosis: an inert substance triggers symptoms in about a quarter of people. Repeat it before you act on it, and take it to a clinician.": {
      "localizations": {
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le coppie pendono dalla stessa parte abbastanza spesso da rendere il caso una spiegazione poco probabile. Non è la stessa cosa di una prova, e un confronto solo non è una diagnosi: una sostanza inerte scatena sintomi in circa un quarto delle persone. Ripetilo prima di agire, e portalo a un medico."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The pairs lean the same way often enough that chance alone is an unlikely explanation. That is not the same as proof, and one comparison is not a diagnosis: an inert substance triggers symptoms in about a quarter of people. Repeat it before you act on it, and take it to a clinician."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The plan is frozen before you start: the hypothesis, the outcome and the decision rule are fingerprinted, and the analysis refuses to run if any of them changed afterwards.": {
      "localizations": {
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Il piano viene congelato prima di iniziare: ipotesi, esito e regola di decisione ricevono un'impronta, e l'analisi si rifiuta di girare se uno di questi è cambiato dopo."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The plan is frozen before you start: the hypothesis, the outcome and the decision rule are fingerprinted, and the analysis refuses to run if any of them changed afterwards."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The plan no longer matches the fingerprint taken when it was frozen. The analysis will not run: a comparison whose rules changed along the way cannot be read as if they had not.": {
      "localizations": {
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Il piano non corrisponde più all'impronta presa quando è stato congelato. L'analisi non viene eseguita: un confronto le cui regole sono cambiate per strada non si può leggere come se non lo fossero."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The plan no longer matches the fingerprint taken when it was frozen. The analysis will not run: a comparison whose rules changed along the way cannot be read as if they had not."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The question mark marks entries matched by similarity: check them.": {
      "localizations": {
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Il punto interrogativo segna le voci riconosciute per somiglianza: controllale."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The question mark marks entries matched by similarity: check them."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The score was then «validated» by correlating it with mean consistency and mean discomfort. But it was computed from those two numbers: the correlation of 0.84 was the score correlating with itself.": {
      "localizations": {
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Il punteggio veniva poi «validato» correlandolo con la consistenza media e il fastidio medio. Ma era calcolato proprio a partire da quei due numeri: la correlazione di 0,84 era il punteggio che correlava con sé stesso."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The score was then «validated» by correlating it with mean consistency and mean discomfort. But it was computed from those two numbers: the correlation of 0.84 was the score correlating with itself."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The structure follows published reintroduction protocols. The block lengths do not: they come from how much your own numbers carry over from one day to the next.": {
      "localizations": {
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La struttura segue i protocolli di reintroduzione pubblicati. Le durate dei blocchi no: vengono da quanto i tuoi numeri si trascinano da un giorno all'altro."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The structure follows published reintroduction protocols. The block lengths do not: they come from how much your own numbers carry over from one day to the next."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The two lists were kept separate but overlapped: carrot, tuna, parmesan, fennel, sausage and eggs appeared in both. In today's catalogue they are a single entry.": {
      "localizations": {
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le due anagrafiche erano separate ma si sovrapponevano: carota, tonno, parmigiano, finocchio, salsiccia e uova comparivano in tutte e due. Nel catalogo di oggi sono una voce sola."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The two lists were kept separate but overlapped: carrot, tuna, parmesan, fennel, sausage and eggs appeared in both. In today's catalogue they are a single entry."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These are the chances of ending up with a significant result. They are low because a comparison this short needs almost every pair to agree.": {
      "localizations": {
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sono le probabilità di arrivare a un risultato significativo. Sono basse perché un confronto così corto ha bisogno che quasi tutte le coppie concordino."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "These are the chances of ending up with a significant result. They are low because a comparison this short needs almost every pair to agree."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These entries are not here to explain your symptoms. They are here to record what else was going on, because in a diary kept by one person sleep, stress and coffee move the numbers as much as food does.": {
      "localizations": {
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Queste voci non servono a spiegare i sintomi. Servono a sapere che cos'altro stava succedendo, perché in un diario di una persona sola sonno, stress e caffè muovono i numeri quanto il cibo."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "These entries are not here to explain your symptoms. They are here to record what else was going on, because in a diary kept by one person sleep, stress and coffee move the numbers as much as food does."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These numbers use different scales from the ones in use now and are not comparable. «Consistency» ran from 0 to 5 with 0 as the worst value and rose monotonically: it is not the seven-level scale used today, whose best value sits in the middle. It is not converted, it enters no calculation, and it is never added to new data. The period also falls in the months right after lockdown, with hours, diet and stress that are hard to repeat.": {
      "localizations": {
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Questi dati usano scale diverse da quelle di oggi e non sono confrontabili. La «consistenza» va da 0 a 5 con 0 come valore peggiore e cresce in modo monotono: non è la scala a sette livelli usata adesso, che ha l'ottimo al centro. Non viene convertita, non entra in nessun calcolo e non si somma ai dati nuovi. Il periodo cade inoltre nei mesi successivi al lockdown, con orari, dieta e stress difficilmente ripetibili."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "These numbers use different scales from the ones in use now and are not comparable. «Consistency» ran from 0 to 5 with 0 as the worst value and rose monotonically: it is not the seven-level scale used today, whose best value sits in the middle. It is not converted, it enters no calculation, and it is never added to new data. The period also falls in the months right after lockdown, with hours, diet and stress that are hard to repeat."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "They are in the app's temporary folder: share them or save them wherever you like.": {
      "localizations": {
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sono nella cartella temporanea dell'app: condividili o salvali dove vuoi."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "They are in the app's temporary folder: share them or save them wherever you like."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This comparison could not have reached significance with the pairs it has, so the result says nothing either way.": {
      "localizations": {
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Questo confronto non avrebbe potuto raggiungere la significatività con le coppie che ha, quindi il risultato non dice niente in nessuna direzione."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This comparison could not have reached significance with the pairs it has, so the result says nothing either way."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This document reports only what was recorded. It contains no correlations between foods and symptoms, makes no diagnostic hypotheses, and is not produced by a medical device.": {
      "localizations": {
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Questo documento riporta soltanto quello che è stato registrato. Non contiene correlazioni fra alimenti e sintomi, non formula ipotesi diagnostiche e non è prodotto da un dispositivo medico."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This document reports only what was recorded. It contains no correlations between foods and symptoms, makes no diagnostic hypotheses, and is not produced by a medical device."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This is a count, not a ranking: none of these entries is put in relation with how you felt.": {
      "localizations": {
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "È un conteggio, non una classifica: nessuna di queste voci è messa in relazione con come è andata."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This is a count, not a ranking: none of these entries is put in relation with how you felt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
