      }
    },
    "What came up on re-reading the data": {
      "localizations": {
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cosa è emerso rileggendo i dati"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "What came up on re-reading the data"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What counts as the outcome": {
      "localizations": {
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Che cosa conta come esito"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "What counts as the outcome"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What did you eat?": {
      "localizations": {
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Che cosa hai mangiato?"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "What did you eat?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What it does": {
      "localizations": {
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Che cosa fa"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "What it does"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What it does not do, and why": {
      "localizations": {
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Che cosa non fa, e perché"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "What it does not do, and why"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What it produces": {
      "localizations": {
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Che cosa produce"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "What it produces"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What to compare": {
      "localizations": {
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Che cosa confrontare"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "What to compare"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What you can hope to see": {
      "localizations": {
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Che cosa puoi sperare di vedere"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "What you can hope to see"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When a trigger is already known — coeliac disease, a diagnosed intolerance — and what matters is adherence and how things are going.": {
      "localizations": {
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quando il colpevole è già noto, per esempio una celiachia o un'intolleranza diagnosticata, e quello che conta è l'aderenza e come sta andando."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When a trigger is already known — coeliac disease, a diagnosed intolerance — and what matters is adherence and how things are going."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When coverage falls below 70% over a week, the app marks the period as not analysable rather than showing numbers that look sound.": {
      "localizations": {
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quando la copertura scende sotto il 70% su una settimana, l'app dichiara il periodo non analizzabile invece di mostrare numeri che sembrano validi."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When coverage falls below 70% over a week, the app marks the period as not analysable rather than showing numbers that look sound."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When someone else will read it: a diary written as you go is worth more than one reconstructed the evening before.": {
      "localizations": {
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quando lo leggerà qualcun altro: un diario scritto man mano vale più di uno ricostruito la sera prima."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When someone else will read it: a diary written as you go is worth more than one reconstructed the evening before."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When the between-days share is low, a daily average is mostly noise.": {
      "localizations": {
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quando la quota fra giorni è bassa, la media di una giornata è per lo più rumore."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When the between-days share is low, a daily average is mostly noise."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Where we put our hands up": {
      "localizations": {
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dove alziamo le mani"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Where we put our hands up"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Whether a food affects you is, in most cases, not knowable from a diary alone. Tratto says so instead of guessing.": {
      "localizations": {
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Se un alimento ti riguardi o no, nella maggior parte dei casi, da un diario soltanto non si può sapere. Tratto lo dice invece di tirare a indovinare."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Whether a food affects you is, in most cases, not knowable from a diary alone. Tratto says so instead of guessing."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Which meals actually got recorded": {
      "localizations": {
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quali pasti venivano registrati davvero"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Which meals actually got recorded"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Who needs this diary anyway": {
      "localizations": {
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A chi serve comunque questo diario"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Who needs this diary anyway"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Whole foods cannot be blinded: you will know which block is which. The comparison ingredient is not a placebo, it is something you do not suspect, so that expectation has something to be measured against.": {
      "localizations": {
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gli alimenti interi non si possono accecare: saprai quale blocco è quale. L'ingrediente di confronto non è un placebo, è qualcosa che non sospetti, così che l'aspettativa abbia qualcosa contro cui essere misurata."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Whole foods cannot be blinded: you will know which block is which. The comparison ingredient is not a placebo, it is something you do not suspect, so that expectation has something to be measured against."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Why a planned comparison": {
      "localizations": {
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Perché un confronto programmato"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Why a planned comparison"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Why those results did not hold": {
      "localizations": {
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Perché quei risultati non reggevano"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Why those results did not hold"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "With %lld pairs no result can be significant, whatever happens. You would need at least 6 pairs for a two-sided hypothesis, or 5 for a one-sided one.": {
      "localizations": {
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Con %lld coppie nessun risultato può essere significativo, qualunque cosa succeda. Ne servirebbero almeno 6 per un'ipotesi bilaterale, o 5 per una unilaterale."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "With %lld pairs no result can be significant, whatever happens. You would need at least 6 pairs for a two-sided hypothesis, or 5 for a one-sided one."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Worst abdominal pain in the last 24 hours": {
      "localizations": {
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Il peggior dolore alla pancia nelle ultime 24 ore"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Worst abdominal pain in the last 24 hours"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Write them the way you would say them out loud. One tap on the Now screen logs them.": {
      "localizations": {
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Scrivili come li diresti ad alta voce. Un tocco nella schermata Adesso li registra."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Write them the way you would say them out loud. One tap on the Now screen logs them."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You pick one ingredient to test and one to compare it against.": {
      "localizations": {
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Scegli un ingrediente da provare e uno con cui confrontarlo."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You pick one ingredient to test and one to compare it against."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your own series still resembles itself 3 days later and stops doing so at 4. That is where the default gap comes from, not from a protocol.": {
      "localizations": {
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La tua serie si somiglia ancora a 3 giorni di distanza e smette di farlo a 4. Da lì viene la pausa predefinita, non da un protocollo."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your own series still resembles itself 3 days later and stops doing so at 4. That is where the default gap comes from, not from a protocol."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your pain moves by about %@ points from one day to the next with nothing in particular happening. That is worth knowing before you can say whether anything changes it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Il tuo dolore cambia di circa %@ punti da un giorno all'altro senza che sia successo niente di particolare. Serve saperlo prima di poter dire se qualcosa lo cambia davvero."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your pain moves by about %@ points from one day to the next with nothing in particular happening. That is worth knowing before you can say whether anything changes it."
          }
        }
      }
    },
